<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for Wednesday was estimated at $9.28 per cwt live, up 0.04 when compared to Wednesday's value. - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S.</p>
<p>TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE (STEER) -</p>
<p>				     Lbs    Price  Change    Prev</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 5.19   89.00    -	 5.92</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   19.75    -	 0.24</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   16.75    0.50    0.75</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  175.00    -	 0.46</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   67.00    1.00    0.21</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   50.00    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  130.00    -	 0.21</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   24.00    -	 0.09</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   72.50    5.50    0.08</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   33.50    -	 0.32</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   27.00   -1.00    0.18</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   56.00    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    4.60    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.25    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  255.50   -2.00    0.47</p>
<p>Blood meal, 85% blk/ton	0.60  550.00    -	 0.17</p>
<p>TOTAL :			   18.92			  9.28</p>
<p>The average value of hide and offal for the four days ending Thursday, November 7, 1996 was estimated at 9.25 per cwt., down -0.10 from last week and up 0.66 from last year.</p>
<p>**HIDE WEIGHT ADJUSTED TO REFLECT SEASONAL CHANGE**</p>
<p>Source: USDA Market News  Des Moines, IA</p>
